WEBVTT

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.216
These are two Danish guys

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.640
who come in and sit down
next to the hidden camera.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.896
And that's me right there in a brown coat.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.576
It's about 30 degrees outside.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.136
I'm wearing a hat. I'm wearing a scarf.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.280
And the girl's going
to notice me right here.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:50.256
(Laughter)

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.496
And as you'll see now,
I'm not wearing pants.

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:56.616
(Laughter)

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.576
At this point --

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.096
at this point she's noticed me,